      <div class="tier-col rv" data-tier="visibility">
        <div class="tier paper">
          <div class="fixtag">YOUR FIX — GET FOUND FIRST</div>
          <div class="tname">Visibility</div>
          <div class="tprice"><span>$</span><b class="amt" data-mon="250" data-ann="225">250</b><span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="tsetup"><b>$997 build fee</b> — site, profile &amp; tracking built once</div>
          <div class="yrline" data-yr="$2,700 billed yearly"></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Conversion website — designed, built &amp; launched in 7 days</li>
            <li>Hosted, maintained, unlimited small edits</li>
            <li>Google Business Profile managed weekly</li>
            <li>Local SEO + tracking number</li>
            <li>Missed-call text-back in 60 seconds</li>
            <li>Live portal + monthly dollars-recovered report</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="tbtn" href="mailto:chase@recoverrevenue.co?subject=Visibility%20plan">Start with Visibility</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-col rv" data-tier="visibilityplus">
        <div class="tier-wrap">
          <div class="tier glass">
            <div class="pop">MOST RECOVERED $ / DOLLAR SPENT</div>
            <div class="fixtag">YOUR FIX — CATCH WHAT THE SITE BRINGS</div>
            <div class="tname">Visibility+</div>
            <div class="tprice"><span>$</span><b class="amt" data-mon="450" data-ann="405">450</b><span>/mo</span></div>
            <div class="tsetup"><b>$1,497 build fee</b> — everything in Visibility, plus chatbot trained on your business</div>
            <div class="yrline" data-yr="$4,860 billed yearly"></div>
            <ul>
              <li>Everything in Visibility</li>
              <li><b>Website chatbot — quotes &amp; captures leads 24/7</b></li>
              <li>Review engine — automated post-job requests, 3–5× review velocity</li>
              <li>Unhappy customers routed to you first — privately</li>
              <li>AI-drafted replies to every review</li>
              <li>Quarterly strategy review</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="tbtn" href="mailto:chase@recoverrevenue.co?subject=Visibility%2B%20plan">Go Visibility+</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-col rv" data-tier="fullrecovery">
        <div class="tier shader">
          <div class="fixtag">YOUR FIX — CAPTURE 100% OF YOUR CALLS</div>
          <div class="tname">Full Recovery</div>
          <div class="tprice"><span>$</span><b class="amt" data-mon="650" data-ann="585">650</b><span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="tsetup"><b>$2,497 build fee</b> — everything below, plus your AI receptionist trained &amp; live</div>
          <div class="yrline" data-yr="$7,020 billed yearly"></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in Visibility+</li>
            <li><b>AI receptionist — answers 24/7, in under 30 seconds</b></li>
            <li>Books straight into your calendar; call summary texted after every call</li>
            <li><b>Lead engine — monthly past-customer reactivation campaigns</b></li>
            <li>Every after-hours call captured</li>
            <li>Priority support — same-day response</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="tbtn" href="mailto:chase@recoverrevenue.co?subject=Full%20Recovery%20plan">Catch every call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="price-note"><b>Every plan starts with a real build</b> — your website, chatbot or receptionist configured for your business. The build fee covers that work once; the monthly keeps it running, monitored and improved. Annual billing is the same plan, 10% cheaper, paid up front for the year. Every plan is designed to pay for itself within the first 30 days; your portal shows whether we cleared that bar.</p>

    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>What if it doesn't make me money?</summary><div class="a">You'll see it in the portal — we report conservatively-attributed dollars, not vanity clicks. After the first 90 days you're month-to-month; if the numbers don't clear your cost, fire us. That risk is ours on purpose. (Annual billing prepays the year — that's why it's 10% cheaper.)</div></details>
      <details><summary>Does the AI actually sound human?</summary><div class="a">Yes — and you'll hear it yourself: ask on your audit call and we'll ring it together. It knows your services and prices, asks the questions your best front-desk person asks, and hands complicated calls to you with a text summary.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Seven business days — really?</summary><div class="a">Really. Day 1 is the kickoff call; by day 7 you approve it on a screen share and we flip it live. We can move that fast because we only build for local service businesses, on a system we've refined build after build.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Do I own the website?</summary><div class="a">Yes — stay 12 months on any plan and the site is 100% yours: code, domain, content. Leave before 12 months and there's a one-time $997 buy-out if you want to take it with you. Either way, no hostage hosting — nothing breaks if we part ways.</div></details>
      <details><summary>What does the build fee cover?</summary><div class="a">The actual build — your website designed and launched, your Google profile rebuilt, your tracking number wired in, and on the bigger plans your chatbot or AI receptionist trained on your services and prices. You pay for that work once. The monthly covers everything after: hosting, maintenance, monitoring, edits and reporting. No surprise invoices, no hourly billing.</div></details>
      <details><summary>What if it doesn't fit neatly — I run a gym / salon / med spa?</summary><div class="a">Same three plans, same prices — the build is what changes. Repeat-visit businesses get booking flows, reminders and no-show recovery wired in; job-call businesses get dispatch-style call handling and reactivation campaigns. Tell us what you run on the audit call and we configure your plan around it. Add-ons like a branded booking app or managed local ads are quoted flat, in writing, before you say yes.</div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FINAL CTA ============ -->
<section class="final dark-band" id="book">
  <div class="rays"></div>
  <canvas id="ctacnv"></canvas>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="kicker">One call. Fifteen minutes.</div>
    <h2 class="h2">Find out what you're <span class="em">leaking.</span></h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width:520px">We'll tell you exactly where the money's going and what catching it costs. If the answer is "you're fine" — we'll say that too.</p>
    <a class="push dark-edge" href="mailto:chase@recoverrevenue.co?subject=15-minute%20call"><span class="edge"><span class="face">Book the 15-minute leak audit →</span></span></a>
    <div class="sub-cta">Prefer email? <a href="mailto:chase@recoverrevenue.co">chase@recoverrevenue.co</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span><b>Recover<i>Revenue</i></b> — Tampa Bay, FL</span>
    <span>Websites · AI receptionists · Review engines · Lead engines</span>
    <span><a href="portal/index.html" style="color:inherit">Client login</a> · © 2026 RecoverRevenue</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<a class="callbar" id="callbar" href="mailto:chase@recoverrevenue.co?subject=15-minute%20call">Book a 15-min leak audit →</a>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.5/dist/gsap.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.5/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
<script>
(function(){
  "use strict";
  var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  var hasGsap = typeof gsap !== 'undefined';
  if (hasGsap) gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

  /* hero entrance */
  if (hasGsap && !reduced){
    gsap.to('.line-mask > span',{y:0,duration:1,ease:'power3.out',stagger:.1,delay:.15});
  } else {
    document.querySelectorAll('.line-mask > span').forEach(function(s){s.style.transform='none';});
  }

  /* generic reveals */
  var rvIO = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){
    es.forEach(function(e){ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('in'); rvIO.unobserve(e.target); } });
  },{threshold:.15});
  document.querySelectorAll('.rv').forEach(function(el){ rvIO.observe(el); });

  /* V2 spotlight nav */
  var nav = document.getElementById('nav'), spot = document.getElementById('spot');
  nav.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(function(a){
    a.addEventListener('mouseenter',function(){
      var r = a.getBoundingClientRect(), nr = nav.getBoundingClientRect();
      spot.style.left = (r.left - nr.left + r.width/2 - 42) + 'px';
      spot.style.opacity = 1;
    });
  });
  nav.addEventListener('mouseleave',function(){ spot.style.opacity = 0; });

  /* V4 scramble kicker */
  var GLYPHS = '!<>-_\\/[]{}—=+*^?#________';
  function scramble(el){
    var target = el.dataset.text, frame = 0;
    var queue = target.split('').map(function(ch,i){
      return {ch:ch, start:i*2+Math.floor(Math.random()*6), end:i*2+10+Math.floor(Math.random()*10)};
    });
    (function step(){
      var out='',done=0;
      queue.forEach(function(q){
        if (frame>=q.end){out+=q.ch;done++;}
        else if (frame>=q.start){out+=GLYPHS[Math.floor(Math.random()*GLYPHS.length)];}
        else out+=' ';
      });
      el.textContent = out; frame++;
      if (done<queue.length) requestAnimationFrame(step);
    })();
  }
  if (!reduced) document.querySelectorAll('.scramble-target').forEach(scramble);

  /* V3 flip word */
  var flipwords = ['missed calls.','dead websites.','lost reviews.','slow quotes.'];
  var fw = document.getElementById('flipword'), fi = 0;
  setInterval(function(){
    if (reduced){ fw.textContent = flipwords[++fi % flipwords.length]; return; }
    fw.style.animation = 'flipOut .32s ease-in forwards';
    setTimeout(function(){
      fw.textContent = flipwords[++fi % flipwords.length];
      fw.style.animation = 'flipIn .38s cubic-bezier(.22,.7,.3,1) forwards';
    }, 330);
  }, 2600);

  /* S1 island */
  var island = document.getElementById('island');
  island.addEventListener('click',function(){ island.classList.toggle('open'); });
  var islandIO = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){
    es.forEach(function(e){
      if (e.isIntersecting){
        setTimeout(function(){ island.classList.add('open'); }, 1800);
        islandIO.unobserve(e.target);
      }
    });
  },{threshold:.5});
  islandIO.observe(island);

  /* A3 kinetic band */
  if (hasGsap && !reduced){
    document.querySelectorAll('.kinetic .row').forEach(function(row){
      gsap.fromTo(row,{x:0},{x:-420,ease:'none',
        scrollTrigger:{trigger:row.parentElement,start:'top bottom',end:'bottom top',scrub:1}});
    });
  }

  /* C2 sticky dots */
  var leakCards = document.querySelectorAll('#leakcards .leak-card');
  var sdots = document.querySelectorAll('#sdots i');
  if (leakCards.length && sdots.length){
    var leakIO = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){
      es.forEach(function(e){
        if (!e.isIntersecting) return;
        var idx = Array.prototype.indexOf.call(leakCards, e.target);
        sdots.forEach(function(d,i){ d.classList.toggle('on', i===idx); });
      });
    },{threshold:.6});
    leakCards.forEach(function(c){ leakIO.observe(c); });
  }

  /* V6 staggered entrance + V5 displacement glow on service cards */
  var svcgrid = document.getElementById('svcgrid');
  var svcIO = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){
    es.forEach(function(e){
      if (!e.isIntersecting) return;
      svcIO.unobserve(e.target);
      e.target.querySelectorAll('.svc').forEach(function(c,i){
        c.style.animationDelay = (i*130)+'ms';
        c.classList.add('in');
      });
    });
  },{threshold:.15});
  if (svcgrid) svcIO.observe(svcgrid);
  document.querySelectorAll('.svc').forEach(function(card){
    card.addEventListener('pointermove',function(e){
      var r = card.getBoundingClientRect();
      card.style.setProperty('--mx',(e.clientX-r.left)+'px');
      card.style.setProperty('--my',(e.clientY-r.top)+'px');
    });
  });

  /* C5 noise wash on dark band */
  function sizeCanvas(c){
    var r = c.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();
    c.width = Math.max(1,r.width); c.height = Math.max(1,r.height);
  }
  var nc = document.getElementById('noisecnv');
  if (nc){
    sizeCanvas(nc);
    var nctx = nc.getContext('2d'), nt = 0;
    (function noiseLoop(){
      if (reduced) return;
      nt += .01;
      var w = nc.width, h = nc.height, cell = 9;
      nctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);
      for (var y=0; y<h; y+=cell){
        for (var x=0; x<w; x+=cell){
          var v = Math.sin(x*.014+nt) + Math.cos(y*.02-nt*1.2) + Math.sin((x+y)*.008+nt*.6);
          if (v > 1.1){
            nctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(126,168,255,'+(.03+(v-1.1)*.07)+')';
            nctx.fillRect(x,y,cell-2,cell-2);
          }
        }
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(noiseLoop);
    })();
  }

  /* dark band counters */
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(function(el){
    var target = +el.dataset.count, suffix = el.dataset.suffix || '';
    if (!hasGsap || reduced){ el.textContent = target + suffix; return; }
    ScrollTrigger.create({
      trigger: el, start:'top 88%', once:true,
      onEnter:function(){
        var o = {v:0};
        gsap.to(o,{v:target,duration:1.4,ease:'power2.out',snap:{v:1},
          onUpdate:function(){ el.textContent = o.v.toLocaleString() + suffix; }});
      }
    });
  });

  /* Cinematic MacBook — pinned lid-open scene (A1 scrub) + zoom-to-pricing */
  var mbp = document.getElementById('mbp'), mbpLid = document.getElementById('mbpLid'),
      pfScreen = document.getElementById('pfScreen'), macCap = document.getElementById('macCap'),
      macHead = document.getElementById('macHead'), zoomlay = document.getElementById('zoomlay');
  var isMobileMac = window.matchMedia('(max-width:760px)').matches;
  if (mbp){
    if (hasGsap && !reduced && !isMobileMac){
      var mtl = gsap.timeline({
        scrollTrigger:{trigger:'#macPin',start:'top top',end:'+=170%',pin:true,scrub:.55,
          onUpdate:function(st){ macCap.classList.toggle('on', st.progress > .82); }}
      });
      mtl.to(macHead,{opacity:.14,y:-26,duration:.28},0)
         .fromTo(mbp,{rotateX:64,scale:.72,y:90},{rotateX:27,scale:1.0,y:-6,ease:'power1.inOut',duration:.78},0)
         .fromTo(mbpLid,{rotateX:-88},{rotateX:-11,ease:'power2.inOut',duration:.62},.14)
         .fromTo(pfScreen,{opacity:0},{opacity:1,ease:'power1.in',duration:.22},.5)
         .to(macHead,{opacity:0,duration:.1},.6);
    } else {
      /* static / mobile / reduced-motion: CSS-transition open on inview */
      mbp.classList.add('static');
      pfScreen.style.opacity = '';
      var mbIO = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){
        es.forEach(function(e){
          if (!e.isIntersecting) return;
          mbIO.unobserve(e.target);
          setTimeout(function(){ mbp.classList.add('opened'); macCap.classList.add('on'); }, reduced ? 0 : 250);
        });
      },{threshold:.45});
      mbIO.observe(mbp);
    }
  }
  /* zoom-through-the-screen transition into pricing */
  var zooming = false;
  function zoomToPricing(){
    if (zooming) return; zooming = true;
    var pricing = document.getElementById('pricing');
    if (!hasGsap || reduced){
      pricing.scrollIntoView({behavior: reduced ? 'auto' : 'smooth'});
      zooming = false; return;
    }
    var r = pfScreen.getBoundingClientRect();
    var cx = ((r.left + r.width/2) / window.innerWidth * 100).toFixed(1) + '%';
    var cy = ((r.top + r.height/2) / window.innerHeight * 100).toFixed(1) + '%';
    zoomlay.classList.add('arm');
    var ztl = gsap.timeline({onComplete:function(){ zoomlay.classList.remove('arm'); zooming = false; }});
    ztl.fromTo(zoomlay,{clipPath:'circle(0% at '+cx+' '+cy+')'},{clipPath:'circle(142% at '+cx+' '+cy+')',duration:.62,ease:'power3.in'})
       .add(function(){
          var y = pricing.getBoundingClientRect().top + window.scrollY - 70;
          window.scrollTo({top:y, behavior:'auto'});
       })
       .to(zoomlay,{opacity:0,duration:.5,ease:'power2.out',delay:.08})
       .set(zoomlay,{opacity:1,clipPath:'circle(0% at 50% 50%)'});
  }
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-zoom]').forEach(function(b){
    b.addEventListener('click', zoomToPricing);
  });

  /* framework of the pain — screen state machine + pricing path */
  var PATHS = {
    have: {
      banner: 'Your leak: <b>missed calls on a site that already exists.</b> Your fix is highlighted below.',
      rec: ['fullrecovery'], dim: ['visibility'], strip: 'dim'
    },
    none: {
      banner: 'Your leak: <b>no website — competitors are taking your local searches.</b> Your fix is highlighted below.',
      rec: ['visibility'], dim: ['fullrecovery'], strip: 'rec'
    }
  };
  var pfStates = {q:document.getElementById('pf0'),have:document.getElementById('pf-have'),none:document.getElementById('pf-none')};
  var siteStrip = document.getElementById('siteStrip');
  var bannerTxt = document.getElementById('pathBannerTxt');
  function showScreen(key){
    Object.keys(pfStates).forEach(function(k){
      if (pfStates[k]) {
        if (k===key) pfStates[k].setAttribute('data-active','1');
        else pfStates[k].removeAttribute('data-active');
      }
    });
  }
  function setPath(p){
    var cols = document.querySelectorAll('.tier-col');
    cols.forEach(function(c){ c.classList.remove('rec','dim'); });
    siteStrip.classList.remove('rec','dim');
    if (!p){
      document.body.removeAttribute('data-path');
      showScreen('q');
      return;
    }
    document.body.setAttribute('data-path', p);
    var cfg = PATHS[p];
    bannerTxt.innerHTML = cfg.banner;
    cols.forEach(function(c){
      if (cfg.rec.indexOf(c.dataset.tier) > -1) c.classList.add('rec');
      if (cfg.dim.indexOf(c.dataset.tier) > -1) c.classList.add('dim');
    });
    siteStrip.classList.add(cfg.strip);
    showScreen(p);
  }
  document.querySelectorAll('.pf-btn').forEach(function(b){
    b.addEventListener('click',function(){ setPath(b.dataset.path); });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-reset]').forEach(function(b){
    b.addEventListener('click',function(){ setPath(null); });
  });

  /* U5 checkbox draw on process steps */
  var chkIO = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){
    es.forEach(function(e){
      if (!e.isIntersecting) return;
      var chk = e.target;
      setTimeout(function(){ chk.classList.add('done'); }, 400 + (+chk.dataset.step)*300);
      chkIO.unobserve(chk);
    });
  },{threshold:.6});
  document.querySelectorAll('.chk').forEach(function(c){ chkIO.observe(c); });

  /* U3 pricing toggle */
  var billTgl = document.getElementById('billTgl');
  var lblMon = document.getElementById('lblMon'), lblAnn = document.getElementById('lblAnn');
  billTgl.addEventListener('change',function(){
    var annual = billTgl.checked;
    lblMon.classList.toggle('on',!annual);
    lblAnn.classList.toggle('on',annual);
    document.getElementById('tiers').classList.toggle('ann',annual);
    document.querySelectorAll('.amt').forEach(function(a){
      var to = +(annual ? a.dataset.ann : a.dataset.mon);
      if (!hasGsap || reduced){ a.textContent = to; return; }
      var o = {v:+a.textContent||to};
      gsap.to(o,{v:to,duration:.5,ease:'power2.out',snap:{v:1},onUpdate:function(){ a.textContent = o.v; }});
    });
  });

  /* C6 final CTA particles */
  var cc = document.getElementById('ctacnv');
  if (cc){
    sizeCanvas(cc);
    var cctx = cc.getContext('2d'), parts = [];
    for (var i=0;i<40;i++) parts.push({x:Math.random()*cc.width,y:Math.random()*cc.height,vx:(Math.random()-.5)*.3,vy:(Math.random()-.5)*.3,r:Math.random()*1.8+.5});
    (function partLoop(){
      if (reduced) return;
      cctx.clearRect(0,0,cc.width,cc.height);
      parts.forEach(function(p){
        p.x+=p.vx; p.y+=p.vy;
        if(p.x<0)p.x=cc.width; if(p.x>cc.width)p.x=0;
        if(p.y<0)p.y=cc.height; if(p.y>cc.height)p.y=0;
        cctx.beginPath(); cctx.arc(p.x,p.y,p.r,0,7);
        cctx.fillStyle='rgba(126,168,255,.5)'; cctx.fill();
      });
      requestAnimationFrame(partLoop);
    })();
  }

  /* sticky mobile call bar after hero */
  var callbar = document.getElementById('callbar');
  window.addEventListener('scroll',function(){
    callbar.classList.toggle('show', window.scrollY > window.innerHeight * .8);
  },{passive:true});

  /* resize canvases */
  var rsz;
  window.addEventListener('resize',function(){
    clearTimeout(rsz);
    rsz = setTimeout(function(){ [nc,cc].forEach(function(c){ if(c) sizeCanvas(c); }); },200);
  });
})();
</script>

<!-- ===== SECTION-NUMBER REVIEW OVERLAY (review copy only) ===== -->
<style id="rvnum-style">
  #rvnum-layer{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:99999}
  .rvnum{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;font:700 11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;
    letter-spacing:.5px;color:#fff;background:#e0261d;border-radius:999px;
    min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    padding:0 7px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.35);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.9)}
  #rvnum-key{position:fixed;top:12px;right:12px;z-index:100000;background:rgba(14,15,18,.94);
    color:#fff;font:500 11px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;border-radius:10px;
    padding:10px 12px;max-height:78vh;overflow:auto;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);max-width:240px}
  #rvnum-key h6{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:#e0261d;font-weight:800}
  #rvnum-key a{display:block;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:3px 0;opacity:.82;
    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  #rvnum-key a:hover{opacity:1;color:#ff6a60}
  #rvnum-key b{display:inline-block;min-width:20px;color:#e0261d}
  #rvnum-toggle{position:fixed;top:12px;right:12px;z-index:100001;background:#e0261d;color:#fff;
    border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px;font:700 10px/1 ui-monospace,monospace;
    letter-spacing:1px;cursor:pointer;display:none}
  @media print{#rvnum-key,#rvnum-toggle{display:none}}
</style>
<script id="rvnum-script">
(function(){
  var SKIP = 'SCRIPT,STYLE,LINK,NOSCRIPT,TEMPLATE,DIALOG';
  var layer = document.createElement('div'); layer.id = 'rvnum-layer';
  var key   = document.createElement('div'); key.id   = 'rvnum-key';
  var btn   = document.createElement('button'); btn.id = 'rvnum-toggle'; btn.textContent='SECTIONS';
  var blocks = [];

  function label(el, i){
    if (el.dataset && el.dataset.rvname) return el.dataset.rvname;
    if (el.tagName === 'NAV' || /(^|\s)nav(\s|$)/.test(el.className)) return 'Nav bar';
    if (el.tagName === 'FOOTER') return 'Footer';
    if (/kinetic|marquee|ticker/.test(el.className)) return 'Scrolling ticker strip';
    var h = el.querySelector('h1,h2,h3,.kicker,.lx-eye,.eyebrow');
    var t = h ? h.textContent.replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim() : (el.id || el.className || el.tagName);
    return t.slice(0, 34) || ('Block ' + i);
  }

  function collect(){
    blocks = [];
    Array.prototype.forEach.call(document.body.children, function(el){
      if (SKIP.indexOf(el.tagName) > -1) return;
      if (el.id === 'rvnum-layer' || el.id === 'rvnum-key' || el.id === 'rvnum-toggle') return;
      var r = el.getBoundingClientRect();
      if (r.height < 24) return;               // skip invisible / hairline wrappers
      blocks.push(el);
    });
  }

  function build(){
    layer.innerHTML = ''; key.innerHTML = '<h6>Sections</h6>';
    var placed = [];
    blocks.forEach(function(el, i){
      var n = i + 1;
      var r  = el.getBoundingClientRect();
      var top = r.top + window.scrollY, left = r.left + window.scrollX;
      // sit just outside the left edge when there's room (keeps logos/text clear)
      var bx = left > 34 ? left - 26 : left + 8;
      var by = top + 8;
      // nudge down if it would land on top of an earlier badge (fixed nav vs hero)
      placed.forEach(function(p){
        if (Math.abs(p.x - bx) < 26 && Math.abs(p.y - by) < 26) by = p.y + 28;
      });
      placed.push({ x: bx, y: by });
      var badge = document.createElement('div');
      badge.className = 'rvnum'; badge.textContent = n;
      badge.style.top  = by + 'px';
      badge.style.left = bx + 'px';
      layer.appendChild(badge);

      var a = document.createElement('a');
      a.innerHTML = '<b>' + n + '</b> ' + label(el, n);
      a.href = '#'; a.title = label(el, n);
      a.addEventListener('click', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        window.scrollTo({ top: top - 40, behavior: 'smooth' });
      });
      key.appendChild(a);
    });
  }

  function refresh(){ collect(); build(); }

  function init(){
    document.body.appendChild(layer);
    document.body.appendChild(key);
    document.body.appendChild(btn);
    refresh();
    window.addEventListener('resize', refresh);
    // sections that reveal on scroll can change height — recompute a few times
    [400, 1200, 2500, 5000].forEach(function(ms){ setTimeout(refresh, ms); });
    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var on = key.style.display !== 'none';
      key.style.display = on ? 'none' : 'block';
      btn.style.display = on ? 'block' : 'none';
    });
    key.addEventListener('dblclick', function(){
      key.style.display = 'none'; btn.style.display = 'block';
    });
  }

  if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
  else init();
})();
</script>

</body>
</html>
